{"type": "dialogue", "tick": 1323, "wallTimeMs": 1795072621669, "who": "INES", "text": "There it goes. The shadow's bigger every frame."}
{"type": "screen", "tick": 1329, "wallTimeMs": 1795072622364, "from": "WORLD", "to": "CONSOLE"}
{"type": "dialogue", "tick": 1887, "wallTimeMs": 1795072666494, "who": "INES", "text": "When it passes 1.33 r\u209b, where we hovered, will its picture go all black like our window did?"}
{"type": "dialogue", "tick": 2289, "wallTimeMs": 1795072698569, "who": "WREN", "text": "No. Hovering there, the shadow covered 207 degrees of our sky. Orpheus will pass that spot at 85% of light speed, and its motion swings the sky ahead of it. It will see the shadow only 79 degrees across."}
{"type": "dialogue", "tick": 3051, "wallTimeMs": 1795072774709, "who": "WREN", "text": "Same place, different motion, different sky."}
{"type": "dialogue", "tick": 4149, "wallTimeMs": 1795072903143, "who": "WREN", "text": "Frames are arriving further apart. The signal is being stretched as it climbs out."}
{"type": "dialogue", "tick": 4650, "wallTimeMs": 1795072957208, "who": "YOU", "text": "(That view. That's what I dreamt.)"}
{"type": "dialogue", "tick": 5532, "wallTimeMs": 1795073058838, "who": "WREN", "text": "No more frames are coming. Everything Orpheus sent after that last one is still trying to climb out, and never will. Its marker in the window is fading the same way."}
{"type": "dialogue", "tick": 6612, "wallTimeMs": 1795073133771, "who": "INES", "text": "So that last frame is all we get. Did it fall in, or is it stuck there?"}
{"type": "objective_completed", "tick": 6618, "wallTimeMs": 1795073134450, "number": 2, "title": "Watch the Orpheus feed (starboard screen)"}
{"type": "screen", "tick": 6948, "wallTimeMs": 1795073162178, "from": "CONSOLE", "to": "CUTSCENE"}
{"type": "screen", "tick": 6984, "wallTimeMs": 1795073165761, "from": "CUTSCENE", "to": "CHOICE"}
{"type": "screen", "tick": 7002, "wallTimeMs": 1795073176589, "from": "CHOICE", "to": "PAUSE"}
{"type": "dialogue", "tick": 7002, "wallTimeMs": 1795073283519, "who": "INES", "text": "And the rest of the trip, the part inside... nobody out here will ever see it."}
{"type": "screen", "tick": 7016, "wallTimeMs": 1795073310774, "from": "PAUSE", "to": "WORLD"}
{"type": "dialogue", "tick": 7358, "wallTimeMs": 1795073335903, "who": "WREN", "text": "No one outside ever will. Only Orpheus saw it."}
{"type": "dialogue", "tick": 7616, "wallTimeMs": 1795073353009, "who": "YOU", "text": "(Only Orpheus. And me, in a dream.)"}
