{"type": "dialogue", "tick": 7988, "wallTimeMs": 1795073395363, "who": "WREN", "text": "Doctor, one item is left on the survey plan, if you want it. It is optional. A ranging-laser test at the photon sphere."}
{"type": "objective_started", "tick": 7988, "wallTimeMs": 1795073395369, "number": 3, "title": "Optional: take the Tern down to the photon sphere, 1.5 r\u209b (helm)"}
{"type": "screen", "tick": 8002, "wallTimeMs": 1795073411365, "from": "PAUSE", "to": "WORLD"}
{"type": "dialogue", "tick": 8508, "wallTimeMs": 1795073453452, "who": "INES", "text": "The what sphere?"}
{"type": "dialogue", "tick": 8658, "wallTimeMs": 1795073465588, "who": "WREN", "text": "One and a half horizon radii. At that height light can orbit Erebus. A beam fired sideways goes all the way round."}
{"type": "screen", "tick": 8688, "wallTimeMs": 1795073468367, "from": "WORLD", "to": "CONSOLE"}
{"type": "dialogue", "tick": 9174, "wallTimeMs": 1795073516971, "who": "INES", "text": "Light going in a circle. Okay, doc, I have to see that."}
{"type": "dialogue", "tick": 9528, "wallTimeMs": 1795073550941, "who": "WREN", "text": "Photon sphere. I have locked the field to it, to within a centimetre. You will see why that matters."}
{"type": "objective_completed", "tick": 9534, "wallTimeMs": 1795073551560, "number": 3, "title": "Optional: take the Tern down to the photon sphere, 1.5 r\u209b (helm)"}
